{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52637","headline":"与朝主人 · 辨正","name":"与朝主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟鼓沸城闉，戎蕃预国亲。\n神明今汉主，柔远静胡尘。\n琴歌马上怨，杨柳曲中春。\n唯有关山月，偏迎北塞人。\n（同前）（按：道慈、辨正诗，张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》已收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"辨正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}